  "system": {
    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>The arrow slams into your lower back, penetrating deep enough to sever your lumbar spinal cord. Your legs collapse underneath you and you can no longer even feel them! A tragic fate for an up-and-coming hero!</p><p><strong>Effects:</strong> Both your legs are now paralyzed and useless (see under @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.k00PimCWkff11IA0]{Amputated Parts}). Needless to say, you are now also @Condition[Prone]. </p><p><strong>Surgery (Difficult)</strong> will be required for Extraction.</p>"
    },
